    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d431">

                <pb facs="0562" n="474" sameAs="frus:frus1933v05/pg474"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.01/29</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Assistant Secretary of State</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-10-06">October 6, 1933</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Brazilian Ambassador, Mr. R. de Lima e Silva, came to see me this morning to
                    ask me if there had been any change in our attitude toward recognition of the
                    Grau San Martín Government. I told Mr. Lima e Silva that there had not yet been
                    any change in our attitude. He asked me to let him know if we decided to
                    recognize, because his Government desired to act in accord with us in the
                    matter.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer><signed>J[<hi rendition="#small-caps">efferson</hi>] C[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">affery</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
